{"id":"659206","name":"豆腐焖牛肉","author":"_蒍鉨变乖々","authorId":"8010238","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/659206/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"牛肉","amount":"适量"},{"name":"豆腐","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"葱花","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"豆腐切块备用。","img":"images/659206/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"牛肉洗净切薄片。","img":"images/659206/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"加入玉米淀粉，老抽，蚝油抓匀。","img":"images/659206/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"再加入少许花生油抓匀锁住住水份腌制备用。","img":"images/659206/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"锅中热油放入豆腐。","img":"images/659206/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"将豆腐煎至两面金黄。","img":"images/659206/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"放入牛肉。","img":"images/659206/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"加入适量清水。","img":"images/659206/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"适量蚝油，生抽，盐调味，大火煮开焖两三分钟左右。","img":"images/659206/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"淀粉水勾芡后煮开。","img":"images/659206/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"洒上葱花即可。","img":"images/659206/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/659206/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/659206/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/659206/step_14.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}